sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant App as Blazor App
    participant AI as AI Services
    participant DB as Table Storage

    U->>App: Login (dev cookie or prod OIDC)
    App-->>U: Authenticated session

    U->>App: Upload image
    App->>AI: Analyze + Enhance + Generate
    AI-->>App: Result image + metadata
    App-->>U: Rendered result

    U->>App: Bulk generate prompt
    App->>DB: Persist + stream progress
    App->>AI: 10 parallel image calls
    AI-->>App: Images as completed
    App-->>U: Live UI updates via SignalR
